{"id":"de54fb8c1326b2f0","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-K-one-complete.md","title":"K 的一一完全性","display":"thm-K-one-complete — K 的一一完全性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-K-one-complete","aliases":["20-thm-K-one-complete"],"display":"thm-K-one-complete — K 的一一完全性","chapter":"2","section":"2.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.4.2 的 K 分支；统一于 c.e. 指标的展开","source_pdf_pages":[74],"source_printed_pages":[38],"depends_on":["[[20-df-K]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-one-reduction]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-lem-padding]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-K-one-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-K-one-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-K-one-complete — K 的一一完全性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.4.2 的 K 分支；统一于 c.e. 指标的展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>74</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>38</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1f15de2c66c6318e\" href=\"?note=1f15de2c66c6318e\" title=\"20-df-one-reduction\">20-df-one-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 为标准 c.e. 编号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=\\{n:\\varphi_n(n)\\downarrow\\}\">\\(K=\\{n:\\varphi_n(n)\\downarrow\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 表示待构造统一归约指标函数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> 为全可计算二元函数族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1f15de2c66c6318e\" href=\"?note=1f15de2c66c6318e\" title=\"20-df-one-reduction\">20-df-one-reduction</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}K\\text{-}one-complete}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\le_1K,\\\\\n\\exists q\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall e,x,j,y\\ (q(e,x)=q(j,y)\\Rightarrow e=j\\land x=y),\\\\\n\\forall e,x\\ (x\\in W_e\\Longleftrightarrow q(e,x)\\in K)\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}K\\text{-}one-complete}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\le_1K,\\\\\n\\exists q\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall e,x,j,y\\ (q(e,x)=q(j,y)\\Rightarrow e=j\\land x=y),\\\\\n\\forall e,x\\ (x\\in W_e\\Longleftrightarrow q(e,x)\\in K)\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x\">\\(e,x\\)</span> 编译程序，在任意输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 上等待 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in W_e\">\\(x\\in W_e\\)</span>，看到停止见证时输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 未入，所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 上都不停止。s-m-n 给全可计算程序码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(e,x)\">\\(d(e,x)\\)</span>，padding 令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(e,x)=p(d(e,x),\\langle e,x\\rangle)\">\\(q(e,x)=p(d(e,x),\\langle e,x\\rangle)\\)</span>。若两个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 码相等，padding 的整体单射性使配对参数相等，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x\">\\(e,x\\)</span> 全部相等。padding 保持程序函数，因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q(e,x)\\in K\\iff\\varphi_{q(e,x)}(q(e,x))\\downarrow\\iff x\\in W_e.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q(e,x)\\in K\\iff\\varphi_{q(e,x)}(q(e,x))\\downarrow\\iff x\\in W_e.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=W_e\">\\(A=W_e\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mapsto q(e,x)\">\\(x\\mapsto q(e,x)\\)</span> 就是一一归约。这个统一编译器也说明任何已给定 c.e. 家族的存在见证问题均可交给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>，不需要从非一致的集合存在性论断提取索引。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_0,K_1\">\\(K_0,K_1\\)</span> 的完备性与同构由已有 halting-set-isomorphisms 原子处理。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 38 / PDF 74。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-K]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-one-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"1f15de2c66c6318e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-one-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-padding","status":"resolved","id":"743a0376168bb7ec","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-padding]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-one-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"1f15de2c66c6318e","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-padding","status":"resolved","id":"743a0376168bb7ec","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"K=\\{n:\\varphi_n(n)\\downarrow\\}","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}K\\text{-}one-complete}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\le_1K,\\\\\n\\exists q\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall e,x,j,y\\ (q(e,x)=q(j,y)\\Rightarrow e=j\\land x=y),\\\\\n\\forall e,x\\ (x\\in W_e\\Longleftrightarrow q(e,x)\\in K)\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"e,x","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in W_e","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"d(e,x)","display":false},{"tex":"q(e,x)=p(d(e,x),\\langle e,x\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"e,x","display":false},{"tex":"q(e,x)\\in K\\iff\\varphi_{q(e,x)}(q(e,x))\\downarrow\\iff x\\in W_e.","display":true},{"tex":"A=W_e","display":false},{"tex":"x\\mapsto q(e,x)","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K_0,K_1","display":false}],"bytes":2163,"backlinks":[{"id":"bc7d5064491f1d37","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-gl1]]；se